<h1>A HOMEBODY'S GUIDE TO AT HOME WELLNESS FOR A PERFECT DAY !</h1>
<p>I remember when I first started learning cooking, I had a lot of confusion as in what to make for my first dish. You could try something that is sweet, spicy or tangy which blends well with your taste buds. Start with a recipe which is easy, scrumptious and less time consuming. It dosen’t have to be perfect. I remember burning my whole pizza when I tried learning cooking for the first time. But with time and practice, everything will fall into place. Eating clean dosen’t mean you suddenly become a health freak. Say you replace your evening crisps with a hazelnut salad or add a bowl of fruits to your daily diet. The goal shouldn’t be to lose weight, but to feel lighter and fit. Start going to the gym or just start taking a walk every morning. Once you start to eat healthy and look after your health, you will be more confident with your life. Did you know taking a day for yourself can reduce stress, boost your mood and help you sleep better at night? It dosen’t have to be grand, it can simply be something like a good skincare routine or taking a spa day. The relaxation gained will improve your mental well-being drastically..</p>
